 voice is unavailable. Try another browser or system voice.','synthesis-failed':'This browser could not start a device voice. Try another browser or enable a system speech voice.'};if(e.error!=='canceled')toast(messages[e.error]||'Narration could not start. Check that a device speech voice is available.')};speechSynthesis.speak(utterance)}
